cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Widget Mot astro du jour
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Daniel
    family-names: Dubois
    email: daniel@web-eau.net
repository-code: 'https://github.com/astrosemantics/widget_mot_du_jour'
abstract: >-
  An Android widget (KWGT, 4×3 format) that presents one
  astronomy word a day from a glossary of 290 words in 12
  themes, with a simple definition, a concrete example, a
  small drawing and a Wikipedia link. On sky-event days (Moon
  phases, equinoxes and solstices, meteor showers) the word
  follows the news of the sky. Turns red at night. Texts in
  French.
keywords:
  - Android
  - Widget
  - Astronomy
  - Glossary
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.1.0
date-released: '2026-10-25'
